  "_comment": "Piedmont (8km-city plan P3): the full city on the P1/P2 sandbox's world â€” terrain + multi-site road recipe copied VERBATIM from piedmont_roads.json (same seeds, so the erosion/conform caches hit), plus the citysim block that builds it: lots + buildings on the metro's blocks, per-hub-cluster civic anchors (each town gets its school + church), piedmont-scale parcel grain (150 m+ blocks parcel bigger lots), and the P5 scattering sky + volumetric clouds as its flagship consumer.",
  "citysim": {
    "_comment_clock": "8 km world: agents move at real m/s while the clock runs at hoursPerSecond, so 0.05 (180x) made a 3 km commute cost 12.5 in-world hours and a 50 m walk 1.8 h. 0.004 gives a 100-minute day and a ~1 h commute.",
    "_comment_dormancy": "P5: agents past ~1.2 km stop being simulated entirely and are rebuilt from their schedule when the player returns. Their parked cars stay put â€” dormancy strips the agent, never the vehicle.",
